```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** 应用启动依赖的配置缺失（`CONFIG_MISSING`）。\n\n**依据：**\n- 日志层面：连续 8 次记录显示 `http_request` 失败，错误原因为 `CONFIG_MISSING`，并伴随 `http_status: 500`（证据 #6）。\n- 追踪层面：Trace 数据显示请求 `/work` 返回 500，且应用内部观测模式明确标记为 `config_missing_exit`，该行为与日志高度一致（证据 #7, #8）。\n- 状态层面：上述业务层错误导致容器以退出码 78 终止，Kubernetes 健康检查失败后执行重启，最终表现为 `CrashLoopBackOff`（证据 #1, #2, #3）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n- 具体的缺失配置文件名称或路径（输入事实中 `unknowns` 明确列出此信息缺失）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 106.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 106.9s (Evidence 99.9s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 147.229, "metrics": {"run_id": "a3bfb78af1aa4ee7", "mttr": {"value": "2.5m", "seconds": 147.22781443595886, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 147227.81443595886, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 110075.39820671082, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 24, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 107466.34292602539, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 36576.81488990784}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 26642.25697517395, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 106881.83426856995, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 13680.863380432129, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

